# Archived copies of older releases.
#
# These live in the working folder but are dead: nothing imports from them,
# no tool builds them, and they are already excluded from eslint and
# prettier. They were tracked, though, and the package manifests and lock
# files inside them were scanned by Dependabot - which is where 12 of the
# repository's 13 security alerts came from. Untracked with
# `git rm -r --cached`, so every file remains on disk and every version
# remains in history; only tracking stopped.
#
# Enforced by scripts/check-repo-hygiene.mjs, wired into `pnpm lint`.
גרסה2.0/
care-platform-main/

# Windows Explorer "- Copy" duplicates.
#
# The duplicated documents are noise. The duplicated CONFIG files
# (`eslint.config - Copy.js`, `package - Copy.json`, `tsconfig.base - Copy.json`,
# `pnpm-lock - Copy.yaml`) are the actual hazard: editing one and wondering
# why nothing changes costs about an hour. The patterns below cover the plain
# form, the numbered form Explorer produces on a second copy, and the
# extensionless form.
#
# Enforced by scripts/check-repo-hygiene.mjs, wired into `pnpm lint`.
* - Copy.*
* - Copy
* - Copy (*).*
* - Copy (*)

# Customer data that was found tracked in the public repository (SEC-INFRA-01).
#
# A real pay summary (names, ID number, salary) and screenshots of a customer's
# workspace were committed at the repository root. Tracking was stopped with
# `git rm --cached`; the files stay on disk for the owner, and rewriting history
# is the owner's decision. The patterns keep them from ever being re-added.
#
# Enforced by scripts/check-repo-hygiene.mjs rule 4: no tracked binary document
# (.pdf .docx .xlsx .zip .png .jpg) outside docs/, apps/web/public/ and
# packages/ui/.
שכר אירודה יוני 626.pdf
bug db/

# Build artefacts, hand-off snapshots and one-off deploy helpers that never
# belonged in the tree (SEC-INFRA-08). The prototype now lives in
# docs/reference/prototype/ and is no longer served from the production origin.
*.zip
netlify-deploy/
test-output.txt
/caredesk_prototype.html
deploy-github-pages.bat
share-prototype.bat
